      "text": "void exit_error(t_config *cfg)\nCleans up all allocated nodes in both stacks, prints \"Error\\n\" to\nstandard error (descriptor 2), and terminates the program with\nstatus code 1.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "baseFontSize": null,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "textAlign": "left",
