      "text": "int parse_args(int argc, char **argv, t_config *cfg);\nLoops i = 1..argc-1. Calls ft_split(argv[i], ' '), checks !tokens || !tokens[0],\nruns process_tokens(), frees via free_split(), checks cfg->stack_a != NULL.",
