      "text": "typedef struct s_config {\n  t_mode  mode;    // MODE_NORMAL (0)\n  int     bench;   // 0 or 1 (--bench)\n  t_node *stack_a; // head of stack A\n  t_node *stack_b; // head of stack B\n} t_config;",
